      "id": "claim_faf7dc32566745739e35ae3ba7c06a70",
      "statement": "step ssh exposes certificate/checkHost/config/fingerprint/hosts/inspect/list/login/logout/needsRenewal/proxycommand/rekey/renew/revoke, and internal/sshutil provides the ssh-agent client (over SSH_AUTH_SOCK with unix/named-pipe variants) with filtered queries such as WithSignatureKey, WithCertsOnly, and WithRemoveExpiredCerts plus Add/Remove key operations.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ssh/ssh.go#L84-L101",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7ecc5035505fa8c61912663633c653d9b2594db276feeef058c9cf852e5d0e65:"
        },
        {
