    {
      "id": "claim_892a36b30dce4dd1aa4c525594d624f0",
      "statement": "step ssh config renders SSH client/server configuration from templates stored on the CA: it posts SSHConfig with GOOS, StepPath/StepBasePath, template version, active context, and --set overrides (discovering User from agent certificate principals and failing without a login), writes returned templates or prints them with --dry-run, and with --roots/--federation prints the CA SSH public keys instead.",
