    {
      "id": "claim_e80204103c694bfca62672c932ae9c8a",
      "statement": "step ssh proxycommand <user> <host> <port> silently performs the login flow when the agent lacks a valid CA-signed key, then relays the connection either directly over TCP (buffered, direction-independent copies to avoid the stdin-close deadlock of issue 1641) or through a CA-registered bastion obtained from SSHBastion by exec'ing system ssh with the bastion's flags and an nc fallback command.",
